scripturesstudio (0.48) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Switch packaging from packaging/deb/ (dpkg-deb --build) to a proper
    debian/ source package (dpkg-buildpackage) with debhelper.
  * Drop legacy audiobible-shmueloff-original, audiobible-shmueloff-darkknox2,
    audiobible-darkknox2-english and audiobible-titles submodules and
    dependencies; depend on audiobible instead, and recommend
    audiobible-shmueloff-source for continued audio production work.

